        "title": "38. Entha kalathilum entha nerathilum",
        "lyrics": "Entha kalathilum entha nerathilum\n\nEntha kaalathilum entha nerathilum\nNandriyaal ummai naan thuthippen\nYesuvey ummai naan thuthippen thuthippen\nEntha velaiyilum thuthippen\n\n1. Aathiyum neerey anthamum neeray\nJothiyum Neeray - en sonthamum neeray- Entha\n\n2. Vaalvilum neeray - thalvilum neeray\nVaathaiyil Neeray - en paathaiyil neeray- Entha\n\n3. Thunba nerathil - inbamum neeray\nInnal velaiyil - en marida nesar- Entha\n\n4. Meetparum neeray - en meipparum neeray\nMenmaiyum neeray - en magimaiyum neeray- Entha\n\n5. Devanum Neeray - en jeevanum Neeray\nRaaja raajaraajanum - en sarvamum neeray- Entha"
