        "lyrics": "Yesu rajanin thiruvadikku\n\nYesu raajanin thiruvadikku\n\nSaranam, saranam, saranam\n\nAathma naatharin malaradikku\n\nSaranam, saranam, saranam\n\n1. Paar pootrum thooya thooya devane\nMei raajaavea enggal naathanea\nBayam neekkum thunai yaavumaaneerea\n\nSaranam, Saranam, Saranam-  Yesu\n\n2. Ilaippaaruthal tharum Devanea\nInnal thunbam neekum arul naathanea\nEalai ennai aattri thetri kaappirea\n\nSaranam, Saranam, Saranam-  Yesu\n\n3. Balaveenam yaavum pokkum vallore\nBelaneinthu valakkaram pidipeerea\nAavi aathmaa sarirathai padaikkirein\n\nSaranam, saranam, saranam-  Yesu"
