        "lyrics": "Vilaintha balanai aruppaarillai\n\nVilaintha balanai arupparillai!\nVilaivin narpalan vaadiduthey!\nAruvadai miguthi aalo illai!\nAntho manithar aligindrarey!\n\n1. Avar pol pesida naavu illai\nAvar pol alainthida kaalgal illai\nEnniladanga maanthar satham\nUnthan seviyinil thonikkalaiyo?\n\n2. Aathuma tharisanam kandiduvom\nAandavar vaakinai yetriduvaai\nVirainthu sendru sevai seivaai\nVilaivin balanai aruthiduvaai\n\n3. Devanin sevaiyil porupeduppai\nUnthanin panginai yetriduvaai\nKarthar naatina thottathile\nKadaisivarai neeyum kani koduppai"
