        "lyrics": "Engellam Theduvathu\n\nEngellam theduvathu inbarin aadugalai\nKaanamal ponathey kaarirul kaanagathil\n\n1. Odiyadi alainthaar avar kaalgalil iratham vadiya\nOnaigal mathiyil sogamaai nirkuthey!\n\n2. Kaadu medu pathaiyil avar aattinai thedi sendraar\nSenneerai sinthiye meettitaar aatinai\n\n3. Thooya thooya rathame unnai kaathu kaluvidum\nKristhuvin sabaiyil serpipaar nichayam"
