        "id": 271,
        "title": "271. Saaronin rojaavey",
        "lyrics": "Saaronin rojaavey\n\nSaronin rojave pallathakkin leeliye\nUllathin nesame yesu en priyame- Saaronin\n\n1. Aathuma nesare um nesam inbame\nPoorana rubamay paluthondrum illaiye- Saaronin\n\n2. Varuvenendruraithavar seekiram varugiraar\nVaakku marathavar thamadham seyyaray- Saaronin"
