        "title": "296. Ennakothaasai varum",
        "lyrics": "Ennakothaasai varum\n\nEnakothaasai varum parvatham nerai\nEn kangalai yereduppen\n\nVanamum boomiyum padaitha valla devanidamirunthe\nEnnukadanga nanmaigal varume\nEn kangal yereduppen- Enakothasai\nMalaigal peyarntha gandridinum nilaimari puviyagandridinum\nMaaridumo avar kirubai ennalum\nAaruthal enakavare- Enakothasai\n\nEn kaalai thallada vottar ennai kakkum devan urangar\nIsravelai kakkum naldevan\nRapagal urangaaray- Enakothasai\n\nValapakkathil nilal avare valuvamal kapavar avare\nSooriyan pagalil chandiran iravil\nSedhapaduthathe- Enakothasai\n\nEth theengum enai anugamal aathumavai kakkumen devan\nPokkaiyum varathaiyum bathiramaga\nKapare idhu mudalai- Enakothasai"
