        "lyrics": "Karthavae Devargalil\n\nKarthave devargalil umakoppanavar yaar?\nVaanathilum boomiyilum umakoppanavar yaar?\n\nUmakoppanavar yaar?\nVanathilum boomiyilum umakoppanavar yaar? - (2)\n\n1. Sengadalai neer pilanthu\nUnthan janangalai nadathi sendreer\nNeer nallavar sarva vallavar\nEndrum vakku marathavar- Umakoppanavar\n\n2. Thoothargal unnum unavaal\nUnthan janangalai poshithire\nUmmaipola yarundu\nIndha janangalai nesithida- Umakoppanavar\n\n3. Kanmalaiyai neer pilanthu\nUnthan janangalin thagam theerthir\nUm naamam athisayam\nIndrum arputham seithiduveer- Umakoppanavar"
